WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Ask normally. Agent works on the left; your notebook stays on the right.

00:02.800 --> 00:07.000
An optional explanation arrives in Owner while work proceeds. No mastery is inferred.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.300
Empty Enter opens your yellow memo. Saving it does not send it to AI.

00:11.300 --> 00:15.000
Empty Enter switches to green local search.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Type a prefix, choose with arrows, insert an exact reference with Tab.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Page keys scroll only the active pane.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
F2 opens actions, including your profile, journal, skills and next-time choices.
